# Files here are deployed by chezmoi to Unix shells — including Git Bash on Windows,
# where chezmoi copies bytes verbatim. A CRLF .bashrc, hook, or modify_ script breaks
# under bash, so normalize all text to LF on every platform (overrides core.autocrlf).
# Binary content is auto-detected; mark images explicitly so Git never rewrites them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
